Someone ported Hack 1.0.3 to the QL. You can find it in the QUANTA library.
However I don't like it because:
- you cannot descend into the maze due to a deadly bug introduced during the
  porting.
- even if that bug is removed you cannot win the game unless you have an
  hard disk, because a 720K floppy disk is to small to hold a save file.
- Hack 1.0.3 is OLD, and Nethack is much better.

If you really want to attempt to port Nethack to the QL, it is better you
buy an hard disk to hold the > 3 Megabytes Nethack 3.0.10 sources :-)

